WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Paste a public company website URL. Early access only — not a live receptionist.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
We read a small, bounded set of public pages and prepare reviewable business facts. Missing facts are not invented.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Review the draft receptionist knowledge pack. Empty hours and services stay empty.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
AI is designed to collect and classify. Fixed rules own safety and money — not the model.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Built for UK maintenance operations, including 999 guidance — never 911.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Pre-launch. This is not a public always-on live phone line.
